{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18902","headline":"送工部萧郎中刑部李郎中并以本官兼中丞分命充京西京北覆粮使 · 刘禹锡","name":"送工部萧郎中刑部李郎中并以本官兼中丞分命充京西京北覆粮使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜简映金章，相辉同舍郎。\n天威巡虎落，星使出鸳行。\n尊俎成全策，京坻阅见粮。\n归来虏尘灭，画地奏明光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}